{"id": "sunol-quarry-rent-and-estoppel", "title": "The quarry kept using City land after the rent stopped", "seconds": 62.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "4aeec8070f31ced2", "words": 187, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In Sunol, the quarry could stop mining a parcel and still need it to store materials and manage water.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.18, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["After", "the rent", "stopped"], "sub": "Sunol quarry"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.87, 1.03, 1.33, 1.48, 1.77, 2.09, 2.17, 2.55, 2.67, 2.96, 3.14, 3.25, 3.37, 3.64, 4.19, 4.32, 4.64]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco’s auditor estimated up to $2,079,884 in rent the City had forgone.", "t0": 5.3, "t1": 10.68, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2,079,884", "label": "Auditor’s upper estimate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.84, 1.27, 1.8, 1.93, 2.12, 2.43, 2.67, 2.98, 3.22, 3.57, 3.93, 4.07, 4.32, 4.44, 4.71, 4.81]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "The utility believed mining royalties replaced agricultural rent. The auditor read the lease differently.", "t0": 10.8, "t1": 16.26, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Two interpretations of the lease"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.74, 1.11, 1.42, 1.89, 2.29, 2.96, 3.73, 3.92, 4.33, 4.51, 4.65, 4.91]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "On a separate list of claims, the auditors identified $40,292 in subtenant rent.", "t0": 16.48, "t1": 22.64, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$40,292", "label": "Subtenant rent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.27, 0.64, 0.84, 0.93, 1.64, 1.8, 2.26, 2.92, 3.24, 3.66, 3.9, 4.24, 4.75, 5.16, 5.29, 5.87]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "The utility said it collected that 